{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40466","headline":"桂江 · 曹松","name":"桂江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未识佳人寻桂水，水云先解傍壶觞。\n笋林次第添斑竹，雏鸟参差护锦囊。\n乳洞此时连越井，石楼何日到僊乡。\n如飞似堕皆青壁，画手不强元化强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}